            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Learn about built-in lint rules.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/docs/getting-started/introduction" class="group block p-6 rounded-xl bg-white/5 border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-amber-500/50 transition-all">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white mb-2 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Introduction &rarr;</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-400">Get started with Soli.</p>
        </a>
    </div>
</div>